# Architecture stabilization roadmap (mandatory — AI execution)

**Status:** Added 2026-07-29 (v0.8.365). **100% AI-maintained** — human director does not implement phases; agents pick work packages from the master plan.

## When to read §8.21

Before **any** task that touches:

- `MainWindow` run/stop/session lifecycle
- `WorkflowEngine` / worker ↔ GUI signals
- `ForegroundWindowMonitor`, profile auto-switch, `ForegroundRunGate`
- `ScreenCapture` target HWND during runs
- `HotkeyManager` hooks, hold/trigger latch
- `SessionRunPolicy` / `PIPBONGPolicySim` scenarios
- Hang / stutter / **응답 없음** with active feature sessions

**Full plan:** [AGENTS.md §8.21](../../AGENTS.md#821-architecture-stabilization-roadmap-mandatory--ai-execution) — phases **R0–R7**, work packages, grep audits, manual verify, progress tracker.

## Agent rules

| Rule | Detail |
| ---- | ------ |
| **Pick work** | Lowest phase with status **Partial** or **Not started** in §8.21 progress table — unless user names a symptom (map symptom → work package) |
| **One bite** | Prefer **one work package (WP)** per user task; update progress tracker when a phase advances |
| **Policy first** | New gate/rule → `SessionRunPolicy` + sim scenario in the **same task** |
| **No MainWindow sprawl** | New run logic → controller / `SessionRunPolicy` / `RunLifecycleCoordinator` (Phase R5) |
| **Close** | POST_BUILD policy sim OK; §8.17 rows when touching foreground/run; §9.7 user summary (**로드맵** line = §8.21 tracker snapshot) |

